na is super important  for the Russians right and on that point  of isolation I I guess this this  conference the Shanghai cooperation  organization this is another opportunity  for the the Russian leaders to show that  he has International Friends  absolutely every appearance on  International stage is very important  for Putin as it shows that the Russian  president isn't isolated in this respect  this conference is also being generously  exploited for propaganda purposes in  Russia nevertheless Putin's trip to  Uzbekistan cannot improve the difficult  situation on the front in Ukraine and  consequently reduce the pressure that is  growing on Putin in his own country  thank you for that Yuri Yuri roschetta  in Riga
 

